{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2684840/extras/Sprite-0001.png?t=1750231018\" /></div>Blaze a trail through the abyss of an ancient temple where the battle between good and evil has been waged since the dawn of time. Felbound is an action-orientated, roguelike game that combines dungeon crawling with RPG-like progression. Slay enemies, collect materials, craft, die and begin again. Gather persistent weapons, spells, potions, and ephemeral blessings to support you on your journey. Rescue precious friends and challenge dangerous bosses while avoiding their deadly traps.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Discover Hidden Chambers</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2684840/extras/Secret_ReducedFrames.gif?t=1750231018\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover hidden chambers full of potions, artifacts and clues to unlock the secrets of the temple. But tread carefully, for danger also lurks around every corner.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Rescue Friends</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2684840/extras/NPCs.gif?t=1750231018\" /></div>Rescue potential friends from the clutches of the shadows. Some will help you on your long and arduous journey by providing you with insight, and powerful equipment. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Find Powerful Blessings</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2684840/extras/Synnergy_ReducedFrames.gif?t=1750231018\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get sanctified for a small donation and, with the right combination of gear, spells, and potions, become the unstoppable god of destruction yourself, only to lose most of that power if you make the wrong step.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Fight Deadly Bosses</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2684840/extras/Boss_ReducedFrames.gif?t=1750231018\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the temple\u2019s abyss, you will encounter a variety of deadly bosses who have only one goal: your utter destruction! They will put your skills to the test, so equip yourself wisely, and plan your strategy, lest ye be crushed into oblivion! </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2684840?t=1750231018","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2684840?t=1750231018","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2684840/9901b6aca3073d7e5e6b4715081a6ff94f268c7d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750231018","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2684840/9901b6aca3073d7e5e6b4715081a6ff94f268c7d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750231018","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3727860,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2684840/extras/Sprite-0001.png?t=1750231018\" /></div>Blaze a trail through the abyss of an ancient temple where the battle between good and evil has been waged since the dawn of time. Felbound is an action-orientated, roguelike game that combines dungeon crawling with RPG-like progression. Slay enemies, collect materials, craft, die and begin again. Gather persistent weapons, spells, potions, and ephemeral blessings to support you on your journey. Rescue precious friends and challenge dangerous bosses while avoiding their deadly traps.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Discover Hidden Chambers</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2684840/extras/Secret_ReducedFrames.gif?t=1750231018\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover hidden chambers full of potions, artifacts and clues to unlock the secrets of the temple. But tread carefully, for danger also lurks around every corner.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Rescue Friends</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2684840/extras/NPCs.gif?t=1750231018\" /></div>Rescue potential friends from the clutches of the shadows. Some will help you on your long and arduous journey by providing you with insight, and powerful equipment. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Find Powerful Blessings</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2684840/extras/Synnergy_ReducedFrames.gif?t=1750231018\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get sanctified for a small donation and, with the right combination of gear, spells, and potions, become the unstoppable god of destruction yourself, only to lose most of that power if you make the wrong step.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Fight Deadly Bosses</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://s